{"seq":2,"slug":"direct-vs-indirect","title":"直接与间接光照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/foundations/direct-vs-indirect","wordCount":1304,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"直接与间接光照\">直接与间接光照</h1><p>把一盏台灯放进黑屋子，桌面被直接照亮的那一圈很容易算——光源在哪、桌面法线朝哪、距离多远，一个公式就出结果。难的是桌子背后那片不该全黑、却确实有微光的阴影区：光绕不过去，但它先照亮了对面的墙，墙又把光反弹回来染了一点。前者是直接光照，后者是间接光照。游戏渲染几乎所有的成本结构、所有的技术分裂，都源于这两者算法代价的天壤之别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一次反弹的分水岭\">核心概念：一次反弹的分水岭</h2><p>把渲染方程里的入射光按「反弹了几次」拆开。直接光照是光源发出、未经任何表面反弹、直达着色点的部分；间接光照是至少经过一次其他表面反弹后才到达的部分。这条「反弹零次 vs 反弹一次以上」的缝，决定了两条完全不同的算法路线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[光源] --&gt;|直达| B[着色点 P]&#10;  A --&gt;|先照亮| C[其他表面 Q]&#10;  C --&gt;|反弹| B&#10;  B --&gt; D{入射光分解}&#10;  D --&gt;|反弹0次| E[直接光照&lt;br/&gt;遍历光源即可]&#10;  D --&gt;|反弹≥1次| F[间接光照&lt;br/&gt;需积分全场景]&#10;  E --&gt; G[加阴影测试可见性]&#10;  F --&gt; H[GI 方案: 烘焙/探针/实时]\">flowchart TD\n  A[光源] --&gt;|直达| B[着色点 P]\n  A --&gt;|先照亮| C[其他表面 Q]\n  C --&gt;|反弹| B\n  B --&gt; D{入射光分解}\n  D --&gt;|反弹0次| E[直接光照&lt;br/&gt;遍历光源即可]\n  D --&gt;|反弹≥1次| F[间接光照&lt;br/&gt;需积分全场景]\n  E --&gt; G[加阴影测试可见性]\n  F --&gt; H[GI 方案: 烘焙/探针/实时]</pre><p>直接光照的计算是「有界」的：场景里有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 盏灯，遍历这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 盏，每盏做一次 BRDF 求值加一次可见性测试即可。间接光照是「无界」的：着色点的间接光来自它半球内所有可见表面，而那些表面的亮度又依赖它们各自的间接光——这是个递归。下表把两者的工程特性并排放：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直接光照</th>\n<th>间接光照</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>光源直接照射</td>\n<td>其他表面反弹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N_{lights})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，有界</td>\n<td>全场景积分，递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性</td>\n<td>阴影（硬遮挡）</td>\n<td>环境遮蔽 + 多次反弹遮挡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时可行性</td>\n<td>直接精确计算</td>\n<td>必须近似（烘焙/探针/追踪）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺它的后果</td>\n<td>物体没有受光面</td>\n<td>阴影死黑、画面「廉价」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"直接光照-可见性是唯一的难点\">直接光照：可见性是唯一的难点</h2><p>直接光照本身不难——难的是判断「光源到底照不照得到这个点」。这就是阴影。对每盏灯、每个着色点，都要回答一个二值问题：两点之间有没有遮挡物？把这个可见性函数记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>light</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(P,\\text{light})\\in\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">light</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，直接光贡献就是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{direct}(P) = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} V(P, l_i)\\, f_r\\, L_{l_i}\\, (\\vec{n}\\cdot\\omega_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>可见性这一项的求解，正是整个阴影章的主题——从阴影贴图近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、到级联提升精度、到软阴影把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 从二值放宽成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的覆盖率。本文不展开，详见 <a href=\"../shadows/shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a>。BRDF <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的展开则见 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型 BRDF</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"间接光照-为什么不能直接算\">间接光照：为什么不能直接算</h2><p>间接光照贵在两个叠加的维度。空间上，每个点要积分半球内所有方向的来光；递归上，每个方向看到的表面又有它自己的间接光，理论上要无限反弹下去才收敛。离线渲染靠蒙特卡洛路径追踪暴力采样，单帧可以跑几分钟；游戏只有十几毫秒，不可能现算。所以全部实时方案都在做同一件事：把这个昂贵积分的结果，以某种形式缓存或近似下来。</p>\n<p>一个常被低估的事实是：间接光的「软」恰恰是它最值钱的地方。直接光给你形体与高光，间接光给你「这个空间是温暖还是阴冷」的整体氛围。一张关掉 GI 的画面，阴影区会死黑、物体像贴在背景上；打开后，红墙会把暖意渗进白色雕像的暗部，空间一下子「成立」了。这种颜色渗透（color bleeding）是间接光的签名特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环境光遮蔽-间接光的廉价补丁\">环境光遮蔽：间接光的廉价补丁</h2><p>在没有完整 GI 的预算下，最划算的近似是环境光遮蔽（AO）：不算间接光的颜色，只算它「被遮挡了多少」。墙角、缝隙、褶皱处因为半球被周围几何挡住，接到的环境光更少，应该更暗。SSAO/HBAO/GTAO 这类屏幕空间技术用深度缓冲估算每点的开阔度，乘到环境光上，几乎免费地给画面加上「接触感」。它不是真 GI——它只压暗、不传递颜色，也不区分光源方向——但在中低端平台，AO 常常是性价比最高的一笔「间接光」投资。真正的颜色传递则要等到全局光照章的烘焙与探针方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>直接光 = 反弹零次、来源有界，遍历光源即可；唯一难点是可见性（阴影）。</li>\n<li>间接光 = 反弹一次以上、来源是全场景，是个递归积分，实时无法现算。</li>\n<li>两者算法代价的天壤之别，是游戏渲染所有成本结构与技术分裂的根源。</li>\n<li>间接光的价值在颜色渗透与氛围；缺它画面会「死黑、廉价」。</li>\n<li>环境光遮蔽是无 GI 时最廉价的间接光近似——只压暗、不传色。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型 BRDF</a>：直接与间接光最终都经同一个 BRDF 反射。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"why-gi-hard\">为何全局光照困难</a>：把间接光的递归写成方程，看清难在何处。</li>\n<li>同库 <a href=\"../shadows/shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a>：直接光的可见性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 如何求解。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/global-illumination\">游戏图形 · 全局光照</a>：从管线角度看间接光的位置。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"直接与间接光照","id":"直接与间接光照"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一次反弹的分水岭","id":"核心概念-一次反弹的分水岭"},{"level":2,"text":"直接光照：可见性是唯一的难点","id":"直接光照-可见性是唯一的难点"},{"level":2,"text":"间接光照：为什么不能直接算","id":"间接光照-为什么不能直接算"},{"level":2,"text":"环境光遮蔽：间接光的廉价补丁","id":"环境光遮蔽-间接光的廉价补丁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"光照模型 BRDF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/foundations/lighting-models"},"next":{"title":"为何全局光照困难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/foundations/why-gi-hard"}}